-- subshells in Aufbau/Madelung order:
--   2,2,6,2,6,2,10,6,2,10,6,2,14,10,6,2,...
-- Every term is of the already-proved subshell-capacity form 4*l+2.  What is
-- still unpaid is the same-object theorem that the DASHI MDL selector chooses
-- precisely this l-order (including the n+l,n / near-degeneracy ordering).
------------------------------------------------------------------------

